meta {
  name: 43-two-factor
  seq: 43
}

docs {
  Two-step login settings. Current official clients read each provider nested
  (`{ authenticator: {...}, userVerificationToken }`) and send the
  `userVerificationToken` back when they change it, instead of the master
  password.

  No request here turns a provider on, so later folders keep logging in with a
  password only. Turning one on needs a real code (a TOTP, a YubiKey OTP, a
  WebAuthn assertion), which belongs in a browser test.
}
